## Icons

Chrome icons come from `FluentIcons.WinUI` (`xmlns:ic="using:FluentIcons.WinUI"`). Use named `FluentIcon` / `FluentIconSource` values. Do not add Segoe hex `FontIcon` glyphs and do not add a second pack (Lucide, Tabler, Heroicons, Fluent Emoji).

- Command buttons stay **icon + existing text**. Do not convert toolbars to icon-only. Skip repeated “Remove” chip buttons.
- Room identity icons are a curated string id on `Collection.Icon` / `Room.Icon`, normalized by `Helpers/RoomIcons.cs` (default `BuildingBank`). Parse to the Fluent enum only in `Helpers/FluentGlyph.cs` — ViewModels stay pack-free.
- Gallery for names: https://davidxuang.github.io/FluentIcons/ — if an enum is missing, pick the closest Regular sibling.
- Keep existing `AutomationProperties.AutomationId` values; new pickers get stable ids (e.g. `GrdRoomIcons`, `CmbMosaicSort` / `CmbTagMosaicSort`). Tag chips use `TagChipItem.AutomationId` (`BtnTagChip_` / `BtnTagFilter_` / `BtnAssignChip_`). Board and assign groups use `TagBoardGroup.AutomationId` (`BtnTagGroup_`). Library mosaic folder headers use `TxtFolderGroup_` (`AssetItem.FolderGroupAutomationId`). Cloud source badges on Library / Tags tiles use `IcnCloudBadge_` (`AssetItem.CloudBadgeAutomationId`) — Fluent `Cloud` Regular, `ThemeResource`, on **every** Dropbox / OneDrive / API / hydrated cloud tile (`ShowCloudBadge`, including a decoded JPEG). Stamp `IsCloudBacked` from the source folder (`SourceKind` / `CloudFile.IsCloudBackedFolder`) plus `CloudFile.IsCloudBacked` on the file — not only `IsOnlineOnly`. Recycled `ItemsView` tiles keep `{x:Bind … Mode=OneWay}`. Kind badges (`IcnVideoBadge_` / `IcnGifBadge_` / `IcnHdrBadge_`) are small Fluent Regular glyphs (video, GIF, HDR) with `ThemeResource`; skip folder headers. HDR uses catalog `Asset.IsHdr` / Radiance path — never Open/recall the original to decide. Fluent `Hdr` Regular has **20 and 24 DIP only**. Mosaic / overlay chips are Accent + TextOnAccent, Size24 (`GalleryMedia.HdrBadgeIconDip`) plus face `HDR` (`HdrBadgeLabel`) so the glyph reads on a tile — Size16 / Secondary is an empty dark tag in library shots. Overlay / GalleryWindow chrome uses the same chip (`ShowHdrBadge` from catalog or live `HdrProbe.IsHdr`, `IcnGalleryOverlayHdr` / `IcnGalleryWindowHdr`). Keep `ShowCloudTile` for online-only without a JPEG.

List / picker item models (`Models/UiModels.cs`, picker entities in `Models/Entities.cs`) override `ToString()` with their visible name: UIA names ListView / ComboBox / AutoSuggestBox items by `ToString()` when no `AutomationProperties.Name` is set, and the default reads the type name (`Palace.Models.TagGroupPick`). New item models must do the same (`ModelAutomationNameTests`).
